d investigators' access to unblinded outcome data is not reported in the captured main report or inspected protocol/SAP pages.","stopping_rationale":"Inspected the complete bounded main-report pass and the relevant supplement protocol/SAP section and front matter. The study period/approval language is not a dated plan-finalization or unblinded-access record. A captured-source lexical search for “unblinded” had no hits; registry retrieval was unavailable at intake, and no outside source was used. Stop with chronology unresolved."}]},{"question_id":"sq:selection:multiple-measurements","answer":"no","bases":[{"evidence":"eh_47bb3cd9ffbaa33c","role":"direct_support"},{"evidence":"eh_2314041b91883396","role":"direct_support"},{"evidence":"eh_358af5abcb650409","role":"direct_support"}],"justification":"The protocol specifies the primary composite at 24 months after randomization, and the report fully reports that composite at the same time point. The protocol and report also describe other secondary outcomes, but these are distinct outcomes rather than alternative measurements of this approved composite. The inspected sources do not indicate that alternative eligible scales, definitions, or time points for this composite were selectively reported.","unknowns":[],"counterevidence":[]},{"question_id":"sq:selection:multiple-analyses","answer":"no_information","bases":[{"evidence":"eh_2ec526b6b3145884","role":"direct_support"},{"evidence":"eh_f9ca31f9807eb330","role":"direct_support"},{"evidence":"eh_34b9e33af5d98c9e","role":"direct_support"},{"evidence":"eh_4ac1a2879c01a120","role":"direct_support"}],"justification":"The plan calls for ITT and per-protocol analysis, and the report says primary/secondary endpoints were analyzed in both populations and reports similar per-protocol results. The report additionally describes Cox and Kaplan–Meier methods, while the inspected SAP passage specifies Kaplan–Meier/log-rank; it does not clearly establish the full eligible set of models